cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FAR-Lab in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "FAR-Lab: Falsification-Anchored Research Chain — a claim-level verification layer for AI for Science"
abstract: >-
  FAR-Lab constrains LLM-generated scientific hypotheses inside engineering boundaries that are
  falsifiable, recomputable, and traceable, via a deterministic five-value verdict kernel (R0–R9,
  no LLM arbiter) and a content-addressed, append-only, cross-language-byte-identical evidence chain
  with tamper detection.
